# Netlify redirect rules (processed top-to-bottom, before netlify.toml).
#
# 1) API calls go to the serverless Express function. This MUST come before the
#    SPA catch-all, otherwise /api/* would be swallowed by the /* rule below.
/api/*    /.netlify/functions/api/:splat    200

# 2) SPA fallback: serve index.html for every other route so client-side
#    routing (React Router) works on direct navigation and page refresh.
/*        /index.html                       200
